FADE IN:

INT. KITCHEN - DAY #1#

Anna stands at the sink, washing a cup that is already clean.

ANNA
You said you would call.

BEN (O.S.)
(from the hall)
I know. I know I did, and I meant it.

He appears in the doorway, keys in hand.

ANNA
Then why didn't you?
(beat)
Never mind.

BEN
I *really* meant it.

They both start talking at once.

ANNA
I told you we should have left earlier.

BEN ^
(shouting)
You never said anything about leaving!

